{"lines": [
 {"key": "hook1", "group": "hook", "text": "Ibn al-Qayyim said: keep your child away from [r]one [r]thing..."},
 {"key": "hook2", "group": "hook", "text": "more than [r]deadly [r]poison."},
 {"key": "rule1", "group": "rule", "text": "First, his [t]rule."},
 {"key": "rule2", "group": "rule", "text": "A child grows up on whatever he's made [r]used [r]to."},
 {"key": "rule3", "group": "settle", "text": "Let a [r]habit settle while he's small..."},
 {"key": "rule4", "group": "settle", "text": "and it becomes [r]who [r]he [r]is."},
 {"key": "give1", "group": "give", "text": "So when you give charity, put it in your [g]child's [g]hand."},
 {"key": "give2", "group": "again", "text": "Let him [t]give it. [t]Again. And [t]again."},
 {"key": "give3", "group": "sweet", "text": "Until he tastes the [g]sweetness of [g]giving."},
 {"key": "lie1", "group": "lie", "text": "And the poison? [r]Lying."},
 {"key": "lie2", "group": "keep", "text": "Keep him from it more than from [r]deadly [r]poison."},
 {"key": "lie3", "group": "ruin", "text": "Because once lying is [r]easy for him, it [r]ruins this [t]world... and the [t]next."},
 {"key": "end1", "group": "end", "text": "Tomorrow's [g]sadaqah? Let a [g]small [g]hand give it."}
]}
